flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Fetch YNAB accounts, categories, groups, and payees]
    B --> C{Metadata fetched?}
    C -- No --> X[Show fetch error and exit]
    C -- Yes --> D[Read transaction text]
    D --> E[Send text and YNAB names to local model]
    E --> F[Parse merchant, amount, memo, account, and category choice]
    F --> G[Set transaction date to today's date]
    G --> H[Match account and existing category/payee IDs]
    H --> I[Show transaction preview]
    I --> J{User confirms with y?}
    J -- No --> K[Discard transaction]
    J -- Yes --> L{Account valid and category specified?}
    L -- No --> M[Do not save; show missing/invalid mapping]
    L -- Yes --> N{Category already matched?}
    N -- Yes --> P[Use matched category ID]
    N -- No --> Q{Category group already exists?}
    Q -- No --> R[Create category group in YNAB]
    Q -- Yes --> S[Use existing group ID]
    R --> T[Check for category with same name in group]
    S --> T
    T --> U{Category already exists in group?}
    U -- Yes --> V[Reuse existing category ID]
    U -- No --> W[Create category in YNAB]
    V --> Y
    W --> Y
    P --> Y{Payee already matched?}
    Y -- Yes --> AA[Use existing payee ID]
    Y -- No --> AB[Create payee from extracted merchant name]
    AA --> AC[Convert amount to negative milliunits]
    AB --> AC
    AC --> AD[Create transaction in YNAB]
    AD --> AE([Done])

    B -. API error .-> X
    E -. Model or JSON error .-> AF[Show processing error]
    R -. API error .-> AF
    W -. API error .-> AF
    AB -. API error .-> AF
    AD -. API error .-> AF
